- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` — same values as the auth module (this module is self-contained and doesn't import from it, so it needs its own copy).
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` — from the Supabase dashboard (Project Settings → API). **Server-only**, never prefix it with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`. Used exclusively by `deleteOwnAccount` in `service.ts`, and only ever to delete the caller's own verified id.


NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

